      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy for AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claudeやブラウザなど、対応するアプリの「Finderで表示」で、対象のファイルをTansuに表示します。切り替え後、開いているアプリの再起動が必要な場合があります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you choose “Show in Finder” in a supporting app such as Claude or a browser, the file is shown in Tansu. After switching, you may need to restart apps that are already open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
